# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages response headers — SOURCE OF TRUTH for the header set.
#
# This file is INERT in both situations that apply to us today:
#   1. Plain GitHub Pages ignores it entirely.
#   2. Cloudflare merely PROXYING GitHub Pages (orange cloud) also ignores it — a reverse
#      proxy does not fetch or parse a repo _headers file.
# To actually SERVE these on the proxied site, copy each header below into:
#   Cloudflare Dashboard -> Rules -> Transform Rules -> Modify Response Header -> Add.
# They apply automatically ONLY if the site is moved to Cloudflare Pages / Netlify.
#
# --- SAFE TO ENABLE NOW: the five simple headers below (X-Frame-Options ... Permissions-Policy).
#     NOTE: X-Frame-Options is SAMEORIGIN, not DENY. DENY would break the same-origin
#     services-catalog poster iframe (service_catalog.html embeds assets/services-catalog-poster.html).
#
# --- CSP = SEPARATE, CAREFUL TASK. The Content-Security-Policy below is INCOMPLETE for the
#     current live site and WILL break features if enforced as-is. Before enabling it:
#       * add every third-party origin actually in use. Known-missing today:
#           embed.tawk.to / *.tawk.to   (live chat)
#           buttondown.com              (newsletter signup)
#           api.github.com              (portfolio repo cards)
#           calendar.proton.me          (booking link)
#       * frame-ancestors is 'self' (not 'none') so the poster iframe still renders.
#       * deploy CSP in REPORT-ONLY mode first, watch the console on every page, THEN enforce.
#
# Crash-app / integration additions already folded into the CSP below:
#   connect-src https://api.tevisengineering.com  -> control-plane Worker; required once the
#       Phase-2 customer portal (browser JS) fetches it cross-origin.
#   script-src/connect-src https://maps.googleapis.com + script-src https://maps.gstatic.com
#       -> homepage Google-reviews widget + Service Areas map. Verify in-browser when the CSP
#       first goes live (Places API New endpoints can shift).

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://www.paypal.com https://script.google.com https://formspree.io https://maps.googleapis.com https://maps.gstatic.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https://formspree.io https://script.google.com https://www.paypal.com https://api.tevisengineering.com https://maps.googleapis.com; frame-src https://www.paypal.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://formspree.io https://www.paypal.com;
